Scope of this license

This MIT License covers the CODE in this repository (model/, scripts/,
tests/). Documentation (README.md, docs/, modules/, CONTRIBUTING.md) and the
study's own processed data (data/processed/, data/sources.yaml,
data/SOURCES.md, model/config.yaml) are licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0); see LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.txt.

Files under data/raw/ are third-party source documents and data. They are
redistributed unmodified for reproducibility and remain under their original
terms (mostly U.S. federal and Washington public records). Neither license
above applies to them. See data/SOURCES.md for each file's publisher.
